nce can never be higher than your resistance cap and negative resistances increase the damage you recieve (up to +100%).\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#伤害抗性#LAST#\n当你受到伤害的时候，会检查对应伤害的伤害抗性。你在受到伤害前，受到的伤害会减免相当于这一比例的数值，可能受到攻击者的抗性穿透的影响。\n你的伤害抗性不会高于你的抗性上限，负的抗性会增加你所受到的伤害，最高增加 100%。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09a8b467dcd0394508c48cc634e7f4c06f2901c5b1e632135e13c67d083ca6b1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d6212cfbaff6e3b8ade262b50a4cb2fe51be641e0298d0bf30fc44093f221d92","logical_entry_identity":"b16e78b67f8b730047e1a0d108e0aa92397fe27fbd9ce72082c4f0a19ab52219","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"mindstar collector","source_tag":"entity name","target":"灵晶商店"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"74feda0b2fa89a057924ba5ccf188f13ff78df9c4d33d097b63f05ce88118d75","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d6215baa4cce07f3faf36919f12fa5e731a817ebcb884490be34e06aa1e85285","logical_entry_identity":"47306f1716d1ba2e088d434168b686602b4396f34bccf34df939d08800113d1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shadowstep","source_tag":"talent name","target":"暗影突袭"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4769cea312910f46441a78c80d1660c861162d264414af521fdb142c5eedb3dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d6251e36c6cc836e8aba48b14c00f670b913acc74e93a25a467efe82063e2cca","logical_entry_identity":"9369629a4249614098de072f2eacd732f6c13eeca2677013b535584fba4b1b62","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stralite ring","source_tag":"_t","target":"斯莱特戒指"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3af30da6122f2d08aa9e01b257e4eec3bc81d7978eb5d3deeec9af6721ecde70","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d625eb46f009f095a73e6bc338e75fb9114c48e0c55b904f188882a90ded098d","logical_entry_identity":"d44ec69dbd4329abdd98fcf8299256eb318a0fd4380045608839e6d0d78b3954","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"totem","source_tag":"_t","target":"图腾"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"88eb5cba5107bbe62a28c5a45b39a5eaea1d21df8aedc17e9e97820de5cb398e","component"